body: `
<h2>Prashn 1</h2><p>Kathan: Saare pen, kitaab hain. Saare kitaab, kursi hain. Nishkarsh 1: Kuch pen, kursi hain. Nishkarsh 2: Saare kursi, pen hain.</p><p>Uttar: Keval nishkarsh 1 sahi hai. Vyakhya: All ke saath All judta hai, isliye saare pen kursi hain, to kuch pen kursi zaroor hain. Ulta sahi nahi hota, isliye saare kursi pen nahi keh sakte.</p><h2>Prashn 2</h2><p>Kathan: Kuch billi, kutte hain. Saare kutte, jaanwar hain. Nishkarsh 1: Kuch billi, jaanwar hain. Nishkarsh 2: Kuch jaanwar, billi hain.</p><p>Uttar: Dono nishkarsh sahi hain. Vyakhya: Jo billi kutte hain woh jaanwar hain, isliye kuch billi jaanwar hain. Iska ulta kuch jaanwar billi hain bhi sahi hai.</p><h2>Prashn 3</h2><p>Kathan: Koi pen, pencil nahi hai. Saari pencil, eraser hain. Nishkarsh 1: Koi pen, eraser nahi hai. Nishkarsh 2: Kuch eraser, pen nahi hain.</p><p>Uttar: Keval nishkarsh 2 sahi hai. Vyakhya: Pencil eraser hain aur pen nahi hain, isliye kuch eraser pakke taur par pen nahi hain. Lekin koi pen eraser nahi hai yeh pakka nahi hai, kyunki eraser ka daira pencil se bada ho sakta hai.</p><h2>Prashn 4</h2><p>Kathan: Kuch kitaab, copy hain. Koi copy, pen nahi hai. Nishkarsh 1: Kuch kitaab, pen nahi hain. Nishkarsh 2: Kuch pen, kitaab hain.</p><p>Uttar: Keval nishkarsh 1 sahi hai. Vyakhya: Jo kitaab copy hain woh pen nahi hain, isliye kuch kitaab pen nahi hain. Doosra nishkarsh pakka nahi hai.</p><h2>Prashn 5</h2><p>Kathan: Saare aam, phal hain. Kuch phal, meethe hain. Nishkarsh 1: Kuch aam, meethe hain. Nishkarsh 2: Saare phal, aam hain.</p><p>Uttar: Koi nishkarsh sahi nahi hai. Vyakhya: All ke saath Some nahi judta. Meethe phal aam ho bhi sakte hain aur nahi bhi, isliye pakka kuch nahi keh sakte. Ulta bhi galat hai.</p><h2>Prashn 6</h2><p>Kathan: Kuch phool, laal hain. Saare laal, rang hain. Nishkarsh 1: Kuch phool, rang hain. Nishkarsh 2: Saare rang, phool hain.</p><p>Uttar: Keval nishkarsh 1 sahi hai. Vyakhya: Jo phool laal hain woh rang hain, isliye kuch phool rang hain. Ulta galat hai.</p><h2>Prashn 7</h2><p>Kathan: Saare doctor, graduate hain. Saare graduate, padhe-likhe hain. Nishkarsh 1: Saare doctor, padhe-likhe hain. Nishkarsh 2: Kuch padhe-likhe, doctor hain.</p><p>Uttar: Dono nishkarsh sahi hain. Vyakhya: All ke saath All judne se saare doctor padhe-likhe hain. Iska ulta kuch padhe-likhe doctor hain bhi sahi hai.</p><h2>Prashn 8</h2><p>Kathan: Saare gulab, phool hain. Koi phool, phal nahi hai. Nishkarsh 1: Koi gulab, phal nahi hai. Nishkarsh 2: Kuch phal, gulab hain.</p><p>Uttar: Keval nishkarsh 1 sahi hai. Vyakhya: Gulab phool ke andar hain aur koi phool phal nahi hai, isliye koi gulab phal nahi ho sakta. Doosra nishkarsh iske bilkul ulta hai, isliye galat hai.</p>
`
