body: `
<div class='quiz-q'><p>Prashn 1: 2 bajkar 30 minute par ghadi ki suiyon ke beech kitne degree ka kon banega?</p><p>Vikalp: (a) 90 degree (b) 105 degree (c) 120 degree (d) 75 degree</p><p>Uttar: (b) 105 degree. Vyakhya: 30 guna 2 ghata 5.5 guna 30 barabar 60 ghata 165 barabar ghata 105, jiska dhanaatmak maan 105 degree hai.</p></div><div class='quiz-q'><p>Prashn 2: 400 saal me kitne odd days hote hain?</p><p>Vikalp: (a) 1 (b) 3 (c) 0 (d) 5</p><p>Uttar: (c) 0. Vyakhya: 400 saal ka chakra poora hone par odd days shoonya ho jaate hain, isliye calendar har 400 saal me dohraya jaata hai.</p></div><div class='quiz-q'><p>Prashn 3: 9 bajkar 0 minute ka darpan pratibimb kya hoga?</p><p>Vikalp: (a) 3 bajkar 0 minute (b) 9 bajkar 0 minute (c) 2 bajkar 0 minute (d) 6 bajkar 0 minute</p><p>Uttar: (a) 3 bajkar 0 minute. Vyakhya: 11 bajkar 60 minute ghata 9 bajkar 0 minute barabar 2 bajkar 60 minute hota hai, matlab 3 bajkar 0 minute.</p></div><div class='quiz-q'><p>Prashn 4: 26 January 1950 ka din kaun sa tha?</p><p>Vikalp: (a) Somvaar (b) Budhvaar (c) Guruvaar (d) Shukravaar</p><p>Uttar: (c) Guruvaar. Vyakhya: Bharat ka pehla Gantantra Diwas 26 January 1950 ko Guruvaar ke din pada tha. Yeh ek prasiddh tathya hai jo aksar pariksha me poochha jaata hai.</p></div><div class='quiz-q'><p>Prashn 5: 12 ghante me ghadi ki suiyan kitni baar ek doosre ke vipreet hoti hain?</p><p>Vikalp: (a) 11 baar (b) 12 baar (c) 22 baar (d) 10 baar</p><p>Uttar: (a) 11 baar. Vyakhya: Milne ki tarah vipreet hone ki ghatna bhi 12 ghante me 11 baar hoti hai, kyunki 11 baje aur 12 baje ke beech wali sthiti agle chakra me mil jaati hai.</p></div>
`
